    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d291">

                <pb facs="0388" n="222" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg222"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.811/273</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American International Corporation.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 26, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    telegram of October 24, 1917, requesting that the following telegram be sent to
                    Mr. Carey through the American Legation at Peking: <pb facs="0389" n="223"
                        xml:id="pg223"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Since canal contract not valid until approved by Parliament regret not
                            possible make legal advances thereon prior such approval. Inform Ono.
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stone</hi>
                        </p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>In reply I have to advise you that the above-quoted telegram was sent to the
                    American Minister at Peking under date of October 25, 1917.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
